From: Ashwin Devi Srinivasan <ashwin@ashds.dev>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:44:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/30] FaceSense: Support private space enrollment [1/2]

Resolve the Sense service using the user targeted by each biometric
operation instead of the current foreground user.

Use per-user daemon suppliers throughout the provider and generate an
enrollment challenge when the target profile has not already requested
one. This allows private space enrollment and authentication operations
to reach the correct Sense service instance.

Schedule the authentication client even when the target user's Sense
service is not bound yet and fail it through the normal error path, so
the framework receives a cookie-correlated HW_UNAVAILABLE error and
BiometricPrompt can fall back to device credential instead of wedging
the auth session.

Change-Id: I8c444f41c5da3c6826f58ebe2c24e78c69ca81ad
Signed-off-by: Ashwin Devi Srinivasan <ashwin@ashds.dev>
Assisted-by: Pi:gpt-5.6-sol
